# AD DS health report

Generated by `scripts/ansible.sh playbooks/ad.yml` after its health gates passed. The playbook
fails before this point if any DC reports a dcdiag error, a replication failure or a SYSVOL
replicated folder that is not in state Normal. (`dcdiag /skip:SystemLog /skip:DFSREvent`: those two
report event-log history, not current health - see `roles/ad_ds/tasks/verify.yml`.)

